  "claims": [
    {"claim_id":"terminology-and-two-layer-model","text":"Most interview cases called 'index invalidation' are better separated into a predicate/index shape that cannot form the desired efficient lookup or range, and a structurally usable index that the cost-based optimizer does not select.","source_ids":["mysql84-index-use","mysql84-table-scan","isolated-review"],"answer_locations":["核心结论","1 分钟版","3 分钟版","关键细节","原理机制"]},
    {"claim_id":"leftmost-prefix-and-skip-scan","text":"Ordinary composite B-Tree lookup depends on usable leftmost prefixes, while MySQL 8.4 Skip Scan is a documented boundary that makes 'missing the first key part means the index can never be used' an invalid universal rule.","source_ids":["mysql84-index-use","mysql84-multiple-column","mysql84-range","isolated-review"],"answer_locations":["核心结论","1 分钟版","3 分钟版","关键细节","常见追问","易错点"]},
    {"claim_id":"conversion-like-expression-boundaries","text":"Indexed-string versus numeric comparison can prevent fast lookup through that string index; constant-prefix LIKE can form B-Tree range access while leading-wildcard LIKE cannot form the same prefix range; unmatched expressions can defeat an ordinary column-index lookup but functional key parts can index matching expressions.","source_ids":["mysql84-type-conversion","mysql84-range","mysql84-functional-index","isolated-review"],"answer_locations":["核心结论","1 分钟版","3 分钟版","关键细节","常见追问","易错点"]},
    {"claim_id":"range-and-cost-nuance","text":"A range predicate on an earlier composite-index key part can stop later parts from extending the same range interval without proving that the whole index is useless, and low selectivity, table size, statistics and access cost can make a scan preferable even when an index is usable.","source_ids":["mysql84-range","mysql84-index-use","mysql84-table-scan","isolated-review"],"answer_locations":["核心结论","1 分钟版","3 分钟版","关键细节","原理机制","常见追问"]},
    {"claim_id":"plan-verification","text":"Actual index use is a plan question that should be checked with EXPLAIN and, where execution is appropriate, EXPLAIN ANALYZE, together with column/parameter types, index definition and statistics rather than inferred from keyword mnemonics.","source_ids":["mysql84-explain","mysql84-table-scan","isolated-review"],"answer_locations":["核心结论","1 分钟版","3 分钟版","关键细节","项目经验版","常见追问"]}
  ],
